{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31608","headline":"长沙陪裴大夫夜讌 · 李羣玉","name":"长沙陪裴大夫夜讌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东山夜讌酒成河，银烛荧煌照绮罗。\n四面雨声笼笑语，满堂香气泛笙歌。\n泠泠玉漏初三滴，灩灩金觞已半酡。\n共向柏台窥雅量，澄陂万顷见天和。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}